class=\"message\">So the Lunar smells &quot;no god or demon&quot; on Boot, and thinks it's not a matter of Exaltation either. It's clearly not blind luck either, however, as it found something to take note of. It implies that Fate and Heaven are involved. Interesting.<br /> <br /> On a sidenote, the Lunar design continues to be great.</div> </div> </div> </div>Get it? Thrown shadow? Throne shadow?<br /> <br /> That was THE pun right after Glories.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/789-mercury","name":"Mercury","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-20T04:58:20-07:00","id":486232,"title":"","content":"Oh... oh. Right. Probably should have thought about that. To be honest, it was so long since I thought hard on Exalted that I sort of forgot about Shadow Fingers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-20T05:18:02-07:00","id":486256,"title":"","content":"Hmmm.... So there is another Exalt around there somewhere? I wonder if we have seen them yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","