{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-26T19:14:17-07:00","id":493136,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=493125#post493125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe the Governor was part of the same group that Boot's mother was?</div> </div> </div> </div>Got to collect them all?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T17:17:24-07:00","id":495452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=493003#post493003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh. <i>Oh.</i> She's out for <i>revenge.</i> And she already got it. Balls. Why go after the governor after that, though...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <i>Prevenge.</i><br /> <br /> Frankly I'm not sure I'd put Sati, of all people, in charge of the not-being-a-monster training. I suppose this Lunar does at least have a sense of humor about the whole thing, which I'd rate as the most important aspect anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/789-mercury","name":"Mercury","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T19:06:55-07:00","id":495619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=493003#post493003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh. <i>Oh.</i> She's out for <i>revenge.</i> And she already got it. Balls. Why go after the governor after that, though...</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, initially I imagine that the Lunar just wanted to kill Boot's mother and then be done with it, but then got caught up with the festival preparations and couldn't sneak off.<br /> <br /> Then Boot revealed her in front of everyone and the jig was up, so why <i>not</i> kill the Dragonblood that is the greatest threat around?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercury</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=495452#post495452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <i>Prevenge.</i><br /> <br /> Frankly I'm not sure I'd put Sati, of all people, in charge of the not-being-a-monster training. I suppose this Lunar does at least have a sense of humor about the whole thing, which I'd rate as the most important aspect anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which one is Sati again?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/ksr/avatars/3507685/Exalted_Back.small.jpg?1370109312\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <hr />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/446-nervaqus987","name":"Nervaqus987","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar446_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T20:06:24-07:00","id":495665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercury</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=495452#post495452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <i>Prevenge.</i><br /> <br /> Frankly I'm not sure I'd put Sati, of all people, in charge of the not-being-a-monster training. I suppose this Lunar does at least have a sense of humor about the whole thing, which I'd rate as the most important aspect anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sati as she appears in this Creation is a few centuries older and wiser than she was back in the Shogunate game we played in, honored goddess. While that game ended, by its conclusion she had taken the first steps onto a different path.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-28T21:43:33-07:00","id":495872,"title":"","content":"I could see that happening, yeah. Would it be presumptuous to ask if her friends had any part to play in that? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T01:52:47-07:00","id":502623,"title":"","content":"Only A Dream Defense<br /> <br /> Well, that was <i>completely </i>unexpected. I'm shocked --<i>shocked!</i>-- that.... Well, okay, not that shocked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T07:14:42-07:00","id":502877,"title":"","content":"An Anathema ate her legs? Yikes! <br /> <br /> Still a bunch of questions. Is the rain god pissed about the failed ritual? Did the governor survive? <br /> <br /> Wyld Ass Theory - Boot is going to see the Lunar, who has a different form. Or someone dangerous who has information on the Lunar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T07:54:53-07:00","id":502921,"title":"","content":"excellent transition between the two &quot;stages&quot; of the page. nice reflections btw. excellent work.<br /> i hope i make sense since i don't want to spoil things for people reading the comments before the comic and i'm still feeling sick <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />, reading a good comic page helps with getting better though <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T13:47:48-07:00","id":503405,"title":"","content":"Well, it's good to see that <b>Haunts-My-Nightmares-With-Claws-Of-Black-And-Ivory</b>* is striving to be an upright member of society by merely maiming the children of enemies.<br /> <br /> Wait! I don't mean that sarcastically!<br /> <br /> If you slay some terrible foe but leave their children around, you're just begging to have monster hunters at the gates of your subterranean lair in a few years. But! If you kill everyone even tangentially aligned with those who oppose you, you have to accept that you're a bad person. A moral dilemma! Luckily, by maiming the children of your foes, you can ensure** that at worst they'll become the bitter mentors of monster-slaying heroes in two generations. Not only is that an extra generation, there's a fair possibility that their protegee will only angrily threaten you a few times before they learn your side of the story and ultimately take a middle-ground towards morality.<br /> <br /> As a bonus, now nobody can question that the victim had nothing to do with you. After all, you bit her leg off! That gives them an increased chance of successful re-integration into their native society rather than being driven forth to become an obsessed wanderer!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> *I don't know the Lunar's name, but I know what the Lunar does.<br /> **With 94% accuracy","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/789-mercury","name":"Mercury","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T17:10:42-07:00","id":503635,"title":"","content":"Unless of course they Exalt, in which case you were probably better off just killing them, because now the new hero has extra drama power from the inevitable &quot;overcoming physical disabilities in an inspiring fashion&quot; story arc.<br /> <br /> The only real way to have a positive end to this sort of story is to not seek <i>revenge</i> at all. Instead, seek <i>justice</i> by bringing the villain's actions to light, and punishing them according to relevant and acceptable law and-or tradition. Someone might still seek revenge against <i>you</i>, but this way you retain the moral high ground which will either win the would-be-avenger over, or simply label them a villain and acceptable target when they deliberately seek self-satisfaction over justice.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately it is the nature of good stories to be messy, complicated affairs and our poor heroine was on the receiving end of what seems to be the long-standing literary tradition of cyclical revenge. Ah well. I suppose if this cycle is going to end, someone needs to receive an epiphany on the difference between justice and revenge.<br /> <br /> So, do the Maidens share the load on this sort of thing Lady Mercury? I imagine most good revenge stories include all five elements of fate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 05-04-2015, 10:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T18:43:08-07:00","id":503715,"title":"","content":"Wow, I didn't see that coming! Boot's got a really interesting backstory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T20:41:26-07:00","id":510411,"title":"","content":"Boot is fighting in a tournament! And apparently sleeps naked. <br /> <br /> But yay, martial arts tournament! Can't wait to see the competition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T20:46:27-07:00","id":510420,"title":"","content":"I had a feeling it'd be something like that... she must be damn good, to compete with prosthetic feet! And a Golden Janissary stylist to boot, interesting...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T22:02:24-07:00","id":510452,"title":"","content":"Ah, so Boot has dedicated herself to learning a spear/lance style from the South, specialising in fighting creatures of darkness.<br /> <br /> Oh!<br /> <br /> Oh, dear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T02:13:16-07:00","id":510512,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WarDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=510420#post510420\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">to boot</div> </div> </div> </div>eh? EH? tenchars<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T10:19:52-07:00","id":510870,"title":"","content":"Golden Janissary, huh? I'm very interested in seeing that style in action. It's one I've been often seen talked about as a &quot;Solar Style for mortals&quot;, but I've never really seen an actual interpretation of it. I'm curious if Boot will be using a &quot;non-essence&quot; variety or if she'll be able to produce the Obviously supernatural effects of, for example, Lone Spark Ignites the Conflagration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T07:39:59-07:00","id":518001,"title":"","content":"Blue Eyed Tavern Maid with an eye for Pretty Boys who play instruments? And out of town strangers? Do her hobbies include hiding in teacups?<br /> <br /> /everyone is a Sidereral, even when they aren't a Sidereal","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T16:12:39-07:00","id":518562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=510870#post510870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Golden Janissary, huh? I'm very interested in seeing that style in action. It's one I've been often seen talked about as a &quot;Solar Style for mortals&quot;, but I've never really seen an actual interpretation of it. I'm curious if Boot will be using a &quot;non-essence&quot; variety or if she'll be able to produce the Obviously supernatural effects of, for example, Lone Spark Ignites the Conflagration.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because this topic interests me, gonna drop in with my thoughts.<br /> <br /> My goal here is for the comic to remain relevant once 3E drops without having to do a silly in-character joke with Sidereals recalibrating reality to the new edition (it's not that I don't love that joke, but Rich Burlew has already done it to death). So everything in the comic so far is something I am assuming will make sense/be legal in 3E.<br /> <br /> Therefore, mortal martial arts are probably going to be a bit less essence-flashy than they might have been in a 2E version of this comic's Creation. I was sort of hoping 3E would be out before the tournament started and I had to draw a bunch of martial artists fighting so I'd have a better feel of combat in 3E, and that might still happen: there's probably 3-5 pages of expository dialogue and prepping before we get to the tournament proper, and 3E is reeeeeeaaaallly close, apparently? And 3E is supposed to do a good job representing cinematic combat, so I figure I'm probably safe as long as my combat scenes are, y'know...cinematic.<br /> <br /> Anyway, the point is moot for now: Boot is by no means a <i>master </i>of Golden Janissary. I don't have 3E yet, but her 2E charsheet says she only knows the style up to the Form.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T18:38:42-07:00","id":518634,"title":"","content":"I never put any attention into Golden Jannisary Style. But now I want to check it out just to see what sort of things is Boot capable of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T23:58:31-07:00","id":519031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=518562#post518562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because this topic interests me, gonna drop in with my thoughts.<br /> <br /> My goal here is for the comic to remain relevant once 3E drops without having to do a silly in-character joke with Sidereals recalibrating reality to the new edition (it's not that I don't love that joke, but Rich Burlew has already done it to death). So everything in the comic so far is something I am assuming will make sense/be legal in 3E.<br /> <br /> Therefore, mortal martial arts are probably going to be a bit less essence-flashy than they might have been in a 2E version of this comic's Creation. I was sort of hoping 3E would be out before the tournament started and I had to draw a bunch of martial artists fighting so I'd have a better feel of combat in 3E, and that might still happen: there's probably 3-5 pages of expository dialogue and prepping before we get to the tournament proper, and 3E is reeeeeeaaaallly close, apparently? And 3E is supposed to do a good job representing cinematic combat, so I figure I'm probably safe as long as my combat scenes are, y'know...cinematic.<br /> <br /> Anyway, the point is moot for now: Boot is by no means a <i>master </i>of Golden Janissary. I don't have 3E yet, but her 2E charsheet says she only knows the style up to the Form.</div> </div> </div> </div>The way I understand 3E is that mortals don't get charms or essence pools, even if they are martial artists...so what type of exalt is boot? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1203-caladon","name":"Caladon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"142"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-19T01:31:16-07:00","id":519070,"title":"","content":"I don't really think Holden's going to come down and dragon punch your computer if you keep enlightened mortal martial artists as a thing that exists, regardless of what 3e has to say on the subject.<br /> <br /> I mean he might try the old &quot;freeze time, throw knives and drop a steamroller&quot; trick but reliable sources inform me that this is dodge-able if you see it coming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2144-guancyto","name":"Guancyto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-19T11:14:23-07:00","id":519802,"title":"","content":"I was half joking and half curious if adult boot is secretly already an exalt...which would almost require flashback arc . Perhaps the whole real story will be told via flashbacks and the tournament doesn't matter much at all. Really this is all baseless supposition. Its Guru's story and he can do whatever he wants with martial arts, enlightened mortals, or anything else whatsoever...up until Holden busts out the dragon punch","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1203-caladon","name":"Caladon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"142"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T13:56:18-07:00","id":529251,"title":"","content":"The important lesson to be learned, here, is that curses are like scars - only really bad if you deal with them poorly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/789-mercury","name":"Mercury","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T14:25:41-07:00","id":529269,"title":"","content":"Is there a specific bureau in Heaven responsible for curses? Do they subdivide based on who's doing the cursing to what?<br /> <br /> And just who <i>is</i> responsible for revenge stories anyway?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T14:53:15-07:00","id":529298,"title":"","content":"Iiiinteresting. I wonder if this is an Immaculate temple we're talking. It might be, but if so, it's probably not where she learned Golden Janissary. She might have basic martial arts training from there, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T08:19:57-07:00","id":529971,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=529269#post529269\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there a specific bureau in Heaven responsible for curses? Do they subdivide based on who's doing the cursing to what?<br /> <br /> And just who <i>is</i> responsible for revenge stories anyway?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the curse in question here was Sidereal Astrology. Violet-Eyed witch, and all that.<br /> <br /> As for who is responsible for revenge...I'm pretty sure Granny Bright used to be a goddess of vengeance, but there may well be more than one. There might be local, regional, and directional gods of vengeance just like there are for other important human centric concepts like war and peace and disease. I'd say Abstract Matters and Humanity are probably fighting over it, just like everything else that's cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T10:52:27-07:00","id":530126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=529971#post529971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd say Abstract Matters and Humanity are probably fighting over it, just like everything else that's cool.</div> </div> </div> </div>I find it hilarious that this conflict exists in Creation because Humans aren't the only sentient+sapient beings in the setting, and thus aren't the only source of Abstract Concepts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T02:50:57-07:00","id":535394,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=529298#post529298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Iiiinteresting. I wonder if this is an Immaculate temple we're talking. It might be, but if so, it's probably not where she learned Golden Janissary. She might have basic martial arts training from there, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>We're in An~Teng. Likely she studied with the monks of the Golden Lord. Again.<br /> <br /> Mmm... You know, I never really linked the Golden Janissary style with the Tenganese religion before. Huh. So bloody obvious in retrospect. How did I miss that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T04:45:50-07:00","id":535462,"title":"","content":"Bet you have to meditate in one of those little alcoves beside the bridge for a while before they rotate you up to meditate in front of the Golden Lord's crotch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T06:03:13-07:00","id":535499,"title":"","content":"So... Tea and Boot are in love, but Tea is betrothed to marry someone else? So Boot is leaving because of that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T08:20:31-07:00","id":535618,"title":"","content":"I read that as &quot;Boot does not have inner peace, so she is leaving despite Tea's wishes.&quot; Tea might be wearing blue consciously because she's trying to dissuade Boot from leaving, or as a general show of love/support, or it might be a coincidence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T08:37:57-07:00","id":535626,"title":"","content":"Tea: I know what you really want. I want the same thing, Boot.<br /> Boot: Then why....<br /> Tea: Please let's not have this fight again?<br /> Boot: I love you, Tea<br /> Tea: ...go to the Monastery, Boot. Maybe the Golden Lord will help you find some kind of peace. <br /> <br /> That snippet and Wise Old Guru's note below about wearing blue to show betrothal makes me think that Boot is leaving because she can't have Tea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T13:48:28-07:00","id":535906,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=535626#post535626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tea: I know what you really want. I want the same thing, Boot.<br /> Boot: Then why....<br /> Tea: Please let's not have this fight again?<br /> Boot: I love you, Tea<br /> Tea: ...go to the Monastery, Boot. Maybe the Golden Lord will help you find some kind of peace.<br /> <br /> That snippet and Wise Old Guru's note below about wearing blue to show betrothal makes me think that Boot is leaving because she can't have Tea.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was my instinctual interpretation as well. I kind of sensed a bit of anger in Boot's words in that scene. She thinks Tea has made a bad choice, and part of the reason she's leaving is probably to assert her independence from her.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T14:07:04-07:00","id":535914,"title":"","content":"And well she should protest! Venerating Venus is a terrible mistake! They should instead travel the span of Creation until they meet their inevitable dooms upon the road, forgetting all notions of love or home.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/789-mercury","name":"Mercury","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar789_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T21:12:16-07:00","id":536462,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=535626#post535626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That snippet and Wise Old Guru's note below about wearing blue to show betrothal makes me think that Boot is leaving because she can't have Tea.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, she should wear silver and elope with Boot instead. Let the Argent Madonna sanctify their love!<br /> <br /> Wait. Maybe not such a good idea. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1516-solarious","name":"Solarious","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T21:17:43-07:00","id":536468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercury</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=535914#post535914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And well she should protest! Venerating Venus is a terrible mistake! They should instead travel the span of Creation until they meet their inevitable dooms upon the road, forgetting all notions of love or home.</div> </div> </div> </div>...Boy am I glad there's more than one of you to oversee the Destiny of all things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T17:59:04-07:00","id":544583,"title":"","content":"Oh my god, that<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Celestial Lion is adorable!<br /> <br /> Also, hypothesis confirmed as for the relationship between Boot and Tea.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ultimate Jade-Screened Exalted Scholar, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1304239-my-next-campaign-tdhr-peach\" target=\"_blank\">THDR : Future Dragon-Blooded campaign</a>, and other links.<br /> If you like Ex3, you can support <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/holdenshearer\" target=\"_blank\">Holden</a> on Patreon!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/541-letipex","name":"LeTipex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar541_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"902"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T19:43:04-07:00","id":544654,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Ah, <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/comics/2144171/page-37-devouring-darkness-diatribe/\" target=\"_blank\">page 37, Darkness Devouring Diatribe</a> is out, in which darkness is devoured by the light, with <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">a side order of ginger cakes</div></div> </div> </div>. Delishiousness.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also not to be missed is Wise Old Guru's commentary which, as ever, provides further enlightenment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T06:07:27-07:00","id":546892,"title":"","content":"This is getting eerie.<br /> <br /> A couple of years ago I drew up plans to make an Exalted webcomic. The protagonist was to be a Tengese girl, disabled during a childhood tangle with an Exalt that also killed one of her parents. She studied as a monk at the Pinnacle of Mercy and made a living as a mendicant.<br /> <br /> She was quite different to Boot, but the resemblances are still uncanny.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I realized that this could be construed as an accusation. It is not! I didn't write down my plans anywhere public anyway. I was just remarking on the similarity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":2093,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","user":"Crumplepunch","date":". 06-09-2015, 10:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T07:15:24-07:00","id":547018,"title":"","content":"Great minds and all that, huh? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T07:19:06-07:00","id":547019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=546892#post546892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is getting eerie.<br /> <br /> A couple of years ago I drew up plans to make an Exalted webcomic. The protagonist was to be a Tengese girl, disabled during a childhood tangle with an Exalt that also killed one of her parents. She studied as a monk at the Pinnacle of Mercy and made a living as a mendicant.<br /> <br /> She was quite different to Boot, but the resemblances are still uncanny.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I realized that this could be construed as an accusation. It is not! I didn't write down my plans anywhere public anyway. I was just remarking on the similarity.</div> </div> </div> </div>One day, I will take an art class* and start my Exalted Wild West Shard Comic.<br /> <br /> *Difficulty I haven't taken an Art Class since 8th grade.... It's been a while...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 06-09-2015, 10:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T20:00:54-07:00","id":547910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crumplepunch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=546892#post546892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is getting eerie.<br /> <br /> A couple of years ago I drew up plans to make an Exalted webcomic. The protagonist was to be a Tengese girl, disabled during a childhood tangle with an Exalt that also killed one of her parents. She studied as a monk at the Pinnacle of Mercy and made a living as a mendicant.<br /> <br /> She was quite different to Boot, but the resemblances are still uncanny.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I realized that this could be construed as an accusation. It is not! I didn't write down my plans anywhere public anyway. I was just remarking on the similarity.</div> </div> </div> </div>Larcenous Painter Style, a little set of exercises I came up with a few decades ago, includes a couple of techniques (Dream-Stealing Distraction and Dead Author Defense) which I have combined into my much beloved Meaning Justifies Ends Stance.<br /> <br /> ...so yes. I snuck into your dreams as you slept, stole the divine fires of your inspiration, and then filed some paperwork to ensure Fate kept your life interesting so you wouldn't get around to sharing your story and mine would be published first.<br /> <br /> Wonder, make your comic. If you set a regular update schedule for yourself and you stretch your talents by trying to illustrate the story effectively instead of hiding your weaknesses (like drawing things so you don't have to draw feet if you're bad at those, for example), then you have regular homework assignments and new material to practice. It's like an art class, if you stick to an update schedule, but much cheaper.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T20:41:33-07:00","id":547941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=547910#post547910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wonder, make your comic. If you set a regular update schedule for yourself and you stretch your talents by trying to illustrate the story effectively instead of hiding your weaknesses (like drawing things so you don't have to draw feet if you're bad at those, for example), then you have regular homework assignments and new material to practice. It's like an art class, if you stick to an update schedule, but much cheaper.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. I can't draw. I tried to draw Flynn from the Clash of the Southwest. It was very stick figurey. And not very good. <br /> <br /> I know drawing is a skill I can develop, but I don't really have the time. Anyways, I got this quest thing going on, so I'm working on refining my writing skills right now.<br /> <br /> But when I am done with that, maybe I'll inflict some stick figure exalted at you guys. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T21:08:06-07:00","id":555258,"title":"","content":"Noooo!!! I want to know what happens next! Stupid tournament. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{