"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T02:04:58-07:00","id":887995,"title":"","content":"I cannot even describe the size of my sadistic shit eating grin at that last panel... also well done Guru, that's a tricky pose to draw.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T02:23:00-07:00","id":888000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=874812#post874812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, seriously, how long has that &quot;hiatus&quot; lasted?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=874814#post874814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Until they find a cure for chronic arthritis?</div> </div> </div> </div>The last update (<a href=\"http://keychain.patternspider.net/index.html\" target=\"_blank\">#383</a>) was posted on (or slightly before) 18 April 2011. So we are at about five years and three weeks and counting.<br /> <br /> His latest communications on the subjects can be found in his Miscellaneous Drawings thread (along with a plentitude of furry porn, you've been warned): <a href=\"https://tgchan.org/kusaba/draw/res/26669.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://tgchan.org/kusaba/draw/res/26669.html</a><br /> <br /> Specifically,<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jukashi</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">My arm is mostly fine, I seldom notice anything day-to-day, but I still get a dull twinge now and then. That's the way it's been for a long time. I have hopes in regards potential productivity but I haven't put it to any very strenuous test. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Now that I've said that somewhere that hopefully people will read it, I will also say that 241e41 there is right, I don't like when people bring it up. Please don't ask again.</span></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://tgchan.org/kusaba/draw/res/26669.html#26724\" target=\"_blank\">https://tgchan.org/kusaba/draw/res/26669.html#26724</a></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jukashi</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#789922\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">&gt;Jukashi, will you ever continue Keychain of Creation? </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">I've never decided I won't, put it that way. But the comic won't be continuing where it left off any time soon. This is another question I've been asked a lot, so if anyone wants to ask it in the future, please just look at what I just said again because it'll be the exact same response. If I ever do continue Keychain, you'll probably hear about it. </span></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://tgchan.org/kusaba/draw/res/26669.html#27031\" target=\"_blank\">https://tgchan.org/kusaba/draw/res/26669.html#27031</a></div> </div> </div> </div></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Sorry for the tangent! I had let God-Kicking Boot slip for a while, and now I've archive binged it back to current. The fact that Boot is a mortal makes this current fight much more interesting. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Ratan is also a lovely character.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":75,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","user":"Weimann","date":". 05-11-2016, 06:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T04:46:30-07:00","id":888057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/311220-god-kicking-boot-an-exalted-comic-by-wise-old-guru?p=887995#post887995\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I cannot even describe the size of my sadistic shit eating grin at that last panel... also well done Guru, that's a tricky pose to draw.</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed. Pivoting on one guy's hand with a stone foot to block the other guy's sword with metal shins, splat honey cake in his face, <i>and</i> swinging a chair with intent? It is <i>freaking awesome</i>!<br /> <br /> As a bonus, there's not a speed line in sight, and we don't miss them. Well drawn indeed.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-11T07:58:39-07:00","id":888203,"title":"","content":"Oh, Ratan. So lovely, so odious.<br /> <br /> Um. Boot stompin' dudes is also fun, of course.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank